# 2. WHAT IS CURASPHERE?

CuraSphere is a Hospital Management System designed to centralize hospital operations into one connected platform.

The system connects:

Patient Registration
        ↓
Appointment
        ↓
Check-In
        ↓
Triage / Nursing
        ↓
Clinical Encounter
        ↓
Laboratory / Radiology / Pharmacy / Surgery
        ↓
Billing / Insurance
        ↓
Payment
        ↓
Discharge / Follow-Up
        ↓
Reporting
        ↓
Audit

The system is not a collection of unrelated CRUD pages.

The patient journey is the central business workflow.

---

# 3. MAIN OBJECTIVE

The objective of CuraSphere is to provide a centralized, secure, maintainable and scalable hospital platform that reduces manual work and connects hospital departments.

The system should provide:

- Faster patient registration
- Better appointment management
- Centralized patient records
- Structured clinical workflows
- Connected laboratory workflows
- Connected radiology workflows
- Connected pharmacy workflows
- Reliable billing and payments
- Inventory visibility
- Hospital administration
- HR and attendance
- Reports and analytics
- Notifications
- Auditability
- Role-based security
- Real-time operational updates where required

---

