# 7. RBAC SYSTEM

RBAC means Role-Based Access Control.

Permission format:

RESOURCE.ACTION

Examples:

patients.read
patients.create
patients.update
patients.delete

appointments.read
appointments.create
appointments.update
appointments.cancel

emr.read
emr.create
emr.amend
emr.sign

billing.read
billing.create
billing.pay
billing.refund

users.read
users.create
users.update
users.disable

Important:

Frontend visibility is not security.

The backend must always enforce permissions.

