# 13. MAIN DATABASE RELATIONSHIPS

Patient 1 -> many Appointments

Patient 1 -> many Encounters

Patient 1 -> many Admissions

Encounter 1 -> many Clinical Notes

Encounter 1 -> many Diagnoses

Encounter 1 -> many Prescriptions

Prescription 1 -> many Prescription Items

Encounter 1 -> many Laboratory Requests

Laboratory Request 1 -> many Results

Encounter 1 -> many Radiology Orders

Patient 1 -> many Invoices

Invoice 1 -> many Payments

User many -> many Roles

Role many -> many Permissions

User 1 -> many Audit Logs

Inventory Item 1 -> many Stock Movements

