# 14. FRONTEND ARCHITECTURE

Recommended:

frontend/src/

app/
components/
features/
hooks/
lib/
routes/
services/
stores/
types/
assets/

Feature structure:

features/patients/

pages/
components/
api/
hooks/
schemas/
types/
routes.ts

Each feature should be independently understandable.

---

# 15. BACKEND ARCHITECTURE

backend/

CuraSphere.Api/
    Controllers/
    Hubs/
    Middleware/
    Extensions/

CuraSphere.Application/
    DTOs/
    Interfaces/
    Services/
    Validators/

CuraSphere.Domain/
    Entities/
    Enums/
    ValueObjects/
    Interfaces/

CuraSphere.Infrastructure/
    Persistence/
    Identity/
    Services/

Principles:

Controllers should be thin.

Application services contain use-case orchestration.

Domain layer contains business rules.

Infrastructure handles database/external implementation.

