# 20. AUTHENTICATION FLOW

Login
 ↓
Submit Credentials
 ↓
API
 ↓
Identity Validation
 ↓
Credentials Valid?
 ├── NO -> Error
 └── YES
       ↓
Load User
       ↓
Load Roles
       ↓
Load Permissions
       ↓
Create Session/Token
       ↓
Protected Dashboard

---

# 21. PATIENT REGISTRATION FLOW

Search Patient
 ↓
Existing Patient?
 ├── YES -> Open Profile
 └── NO
       ↓
Registration Form
       ↓
Validation
       ↓
Duplicate Warning
       ↓
Generate MRN
       ↓
Save Patient
       ↓
Audit
       ↓
Patient Profile
       ↓
Appointment / Check-In

Never silently create duplicates.

