# 59. VERTICAL-SLICE DEVELOPMENT

Every feature should be completed through:

Requirement
 ↓
Flow
 ↓
Figma
 ↓
Database
 ↓
API
 ↓
Backend
 ↓
Frontend
 ↓
Validation
 ↓
Permissions
 ↓
Audit
 ↓
Real-Time
 ↓
Tests
 ↓
Review
 ↓
Staging
 ↓
UAT
 ↓
Production

Example:

Patient Registration is not complete merely because the registration page exists.

It is complete when:

- Form exists
- API exists
- Database exists
- MRN is generated
- Duplicate detection works
- Permissions work
- Validation works
- Audit works
- Error states work
- Tests pass
- Workflow works end-to-end

