# 75. FINAL DEFINITION OF CURASPHERE

CuraSphere is complete when a hospital can use the system to manage the complete authorized patient journey and the supporting operational processes in a secure, auditable and maintainable environment.

The software is not considered complete because all pages exist.

It is complete when:

Requirements
+
Flows
+
UI
+
Database
+
API
+
Backend
+
Frontend
+
Security
+
Real-Time
+
Testing
+
Deployment
+
Documentation

all work together as one coherent hospital information system.

